#: src/SLN/Admin/BookingDiscountDiagnostics.php:154
msgid ""
"Inconsistency: discount_amount meta is set but the discounts list is empty. The Totals "
"tab may show “No Discounts” while old amount data still exists."
msgstr ""
"Inkonsistens: discount_amount meta er satt, men rabattlisten er tom. Fanen Totaler kan "
"vise \"Ingen rabatter\" mens gamle beløpsdata fortsatt finnes."

#: src/SLN/Admin/BookingDiscountDiagnostics.php:155
msgid ""
"Note: keys inside discount_amount are salon service post IDs (per-line reductions), not "
"discount coupon IDs."
msgstr ""
"Merk: nøklene inne i discount_amount er salongservice-ID-er (per linje-reduksjon), ikke "
"rabattkupong-ID-er."

#. translators: %s: comma-separated numeric discount (coupon) post IDs
#: src/SLN/Admin/BookingDiscountDiagnostics.php:160
#, python-format, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Stale per-coupon meta: _sln_booking_discount_{couponId} is still set for ID(s) %s while "
"_sln_booking_discounts is empty. That usually means the canonical list was cleared or "
"overwritten without removing all per-coupon flags."
msgstr ""
"Gammel per-kupong-meta: _sln_booking_discount_{couponId} er fortsatt satt for ID(er) %s "
"mens _sln_booking_discounts er tom. Det betyr vanligvis at den kanoniske listen ble "
"slettet eller overskrevet uten å fjerne alle per-kupongflagg."

#. translators: %s: comma-separated discount post IDs
#: src/SLN/Admin/BookingDiscountDiagnostics.php:167
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Orphan discount IDs (stored on booking but not returned by current discount catalog "
"getAll()): %s. Common causes: coupon trashed/deleted, or repository filters."
msgstr ""
"Foreldreløse rabatt-ID-er (lagret på bookingen, men ikke returnert av den gjeldende "
"rabattkatalogens getAll()): %s. Vanlige årsaker er at kupongen er flyttet til "
"papirkurven eller slettet, eller at lagringsfiltre skjuler den."

#: src/SLN/Admin/BookingDiscountDiagnostics.php:172
msgid ""
"Discount system is enabled but there are no coupons in the catalog, so the booking edit "
"screen does not render the discount field. A booking update that does not include "
"discount fields in POST can clear previously stored discount IDs."
msgstr ""
"Rabattsystemet er aktivert, men katalogen inneholder ingen kuponger. Derfor vises ikke "
"rabattfeltet når bookingen redigeres. En oppdatering uten rabattfelt i POST kan fjerne "
"tidligere lagrede rabatt-ID-er."

#: src/SLN/Admin/BookingDiscountDiagnostics.php:175
msgid ""
"Discount IDs exist in meta while the discount system is disabled in settings; discount "
"logic may not run until re-enabled."
msgstr ""
"Rabatt-ID-er finnes i meta mens rabattsystemet er deaktivert i innstillingene; "
"Rabattlogikk kan ikke kjøre før den er aktivert igjen."

#: src/SLN/Admin/BookingDiscountDiagnostics.php:178
msgid ""
"Stored discount IDs look consistent with the catalog. If the UI still shows “No "
"Discounts”, check for JavaScript/Select2 issues, user role restrictions, or compare "
"post_modified with when staff last saved the booking."
msgstr ""
"Lagrede rabatt-ID-er ser ut til å være i samsvar med katalogen. Hvis "
"brukergrensesnittet fortsatt viser «Ingen rabatter», sjekk for JavaScript/Select2-"
"problemer, begrensninger på brukerroller, eller sammenlign post_modified med når "
"personalet sist lagret bookingen."

